{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 210,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I want you to listen to these two sounds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2250,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and decide which is higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4170,
    "dDurationMs": 1021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is sound A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5191,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sample sound buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6510,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is sound B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7761,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sample sound buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9240,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so to me, sound A is clearly higher,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11730,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's strange"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13110,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because sound A was just\na 100 hertz sine wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16500,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sound B had that same 100 hertz frequency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19050,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also 150 hertz and 200 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23160,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we added higher frequencies,\nbut the sound was lower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27420,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does that work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28980,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there's this idea that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30300,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what our ears do is simply\ndetect the frequency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33060,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of vibrations in our\nenvironment that are between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35130,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "20 hertz and 20,000 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37470,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is so much more\nto hearing than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40560,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in this video, we're\ngonna go through a series"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42780,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of audio illusions that\nillustrate how our sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45360,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of hearing actually works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47520,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of these effects will work on a phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49980,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or laptop speakers, but if you\nhave headphones handy, well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53130,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd recommend putting them\non for the full experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74130,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a whole body\ninstrument, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75720,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Absolutely yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77010,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is the Sydney Town Hall pipe organ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80580,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it was built in 1890,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82440,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was the largest organ in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87930,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something I didn't realize about organs is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89970,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they were meant to\nsound like many different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92220,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instruments playing together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94620,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Organs are sort of a\none person orchestra."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100980,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very flutie, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101813,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- You can tell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103830,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compare that to a trumpet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112260,
    "dDurationMs": 1511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oboe sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122637,
    "dDurationMs": 4023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can hear all these\norchestral sounds on the organ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126660,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We could get inside the instrument too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128970,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Should we go look?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129803,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's have a look. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130636,
    "dDurationMs": 884,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131520,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- For each instrument,\nthere are a series of pipes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134280,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the organ which play all the different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135960,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "notes for that instrument."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137670,
    "dDurationMs": 2514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I mean, there are 8,000\npipes in this organ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140184,
    "dDurationMs": 1373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 8,000?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141557,
    "dDurationMs": 883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 8,000, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142440,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Why do you need that many?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144060,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- To create all the different\nsounds of the orchestra."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146520,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What you see on the outside\nis just a tiny fraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149610,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the organ itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151410,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa look at all these.\nThey're all hidden in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154440,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Titus] They are, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155370,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And some are wooden, some are metal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157110,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some have resonators at the bottom of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158860,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create the more reedy\nsounds, the brassy sounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162120,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then these wooden ones are more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163380,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the deep flutie sounds as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166650,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is like what a keyboard?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168210,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's a keyboard. Yeah, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169500,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A keyboard layout of pipes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181272,
    "dDurationMs": 2388,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Very nice you position yourself well..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183660,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When two pipes of the\nsame length vibrate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185970,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they both play the same note."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190830,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because they're both\nproducing the same fundamental"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193290,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "frequency that is the lowest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195330,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and usually highest amplitude\nvibration they produce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199050,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the pipes are made\nof different materials,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201600,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they will sound different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203370,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can tell they are\ndifferent instruments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206310,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because each\none produces a distinct set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209340,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of higher frequencies called overtones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not as loud as the fundamental,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214440,
    "dDurationMs": 3007,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we don't hear them as distinct tones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217447,
    "dDurationMs": 4313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they affect the quality\nof the sound called timbre."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221760,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's how you can tell apart a trumpet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224250,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from say a flute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have overtones of\ndifferent frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228750,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and relative amplitudes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231540,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a lot of instruments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232680,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most common overtones\nare integer multiples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235380,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the fundamental frequency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237240,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are known as harmonics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239700,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If this was your fundamental note,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242610,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the notes that you're gonna\nbe hearing with it would be..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257100,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all of those notes are\nwithin that fundamental note."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260460,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, harmonics can be\nuseful when you're trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262620,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to play really low notes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264690,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Sydney Town Hall pipe organ is one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266790,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of only two in the world\nthat has a 64 foot long pipe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270870,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's actually so large that it has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272220,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be folded over itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273510,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Where is the 64? Can we see it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275970,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You've got the grand question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277410,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279270,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know it's somewhere here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280590,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Like that's a really big\nchunk of wood right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283530,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284363,
    "dDurationMs": 1297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Could that be it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285660,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This pipe is used to produce\na frequency of 8 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290070,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When you get to that\nlevel, it's more something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291570,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you feel rather than\nsomething that you hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293940,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- For sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294773,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lowest note most big\npipe organs can play is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297300,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "16 hertz, which is just at\nthe limit of human hearing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300840,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even this requires a 32\nfoot pipe, which is too big"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304230,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or expensive for many organs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306840,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know where the 32 footers are?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309090,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Well..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310950,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They're ones out the front?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312450,
    "dDurationMs": 1703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They're the ones that\nyou see at the front."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315300,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316890,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's the 32 footer.\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319020,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So that's nearly 10 meters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321270,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nearly 10 meters. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323010,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty scary to think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324210,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the top of it actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325800,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In 18th century Europe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327600,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Georg Joseph Vogler\nwas a popular organist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331020,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wanted to tour the continent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332700,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that would require building\na compact portable organ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336360,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that he could take with him on the road."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339000,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we obviously couldn't haul"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340320,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the huge 32 foot pipe\nrequired to produce 16 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344250,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how could he still\ncreate the low frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346860,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that make the organ so powerful?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349320,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Vogler realized that\nif he played the harmonics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352350,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of 16 hertz using shorter pipes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355290,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your brain would hear\nthis missing fundamental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360210,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we try the trick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361043,
    "dDurationMs": 1717,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see if it sounds?\n- Yeah, sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362760,
    "dDurationMs": 2984,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fifth is that sort of\nmost common fundamental,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365744,
    "dDurationMs": 3046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which you're gonna hear\nto get the low sound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368790,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but basically the quint\ngets used with a 16 foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372390,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it creates the lower resultant tone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375780,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's just the 16 metal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381180,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's so funny because you add it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382680,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I do not hear it going up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384570,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're playing a fifth above."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386250,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes\n- But I'm hearing it go down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387900,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you just pull that out and I'm like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389310,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh yeah, the note dropped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390480,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's the trick. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391830,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- With the two sounds I\nplayed at the beginning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393720,
    "dDurationMs": 1947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first was a pure 100 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395667,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sample sound buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397650,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the second sound was made up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399300,
    "dDurationMs": 1936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the harmonics of 50 hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401236,
    "dDurationMs": 2963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sample sound buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404199,
    "dDurationMs": 3351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you actually heard this\nfundamental frequency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407550,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though it wasn't there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409350,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how higher frequencies\ntogether can sound lower than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413310,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "low frequencies if they are\nharmonics of a low fundamental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418320,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this might not be\nas weird as it seems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420960,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at the wave\nform of the harmonics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that adding\nthe higher frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425040,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changes the period of the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427260,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes the period longer so\nthat it's actually the same"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430500,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the missing fundamental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432450,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you kind of recreate some\nof those harmonic pitches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436500,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're actually gonna bring\nout more bass in the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441141,
    "dDurationMs": 3159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, the idea of like you\ncould play the harmonics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444300,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and hear the fundamental"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446760,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if you're not\nplaying the fundamental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448290,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's right. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449580,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So different frequency sounds can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451500,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "combine to make notes that aren't there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454140,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they can also do\nsomething, even stranger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457994,
    "dDurationMs": 2386,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hello, it's me, Mario."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460380,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In Super Mario 64, there's a staircase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463410,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that seems to go on forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465300,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Players can't level up until\nthey collect enough coins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468750,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now listen carefully to the music."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471570,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The scale sounds like\nit keeps going up and up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476010,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and up, just like the endless staircase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480930,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the Shepard tone illusion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483060,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and here's a Shepard Glissando on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485680,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(music escalating)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489270,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An ever increasing tone\nshould be impossible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492630,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we can't hear anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494250,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "beyond the 20,000 hertz limit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496830,
    "dDurationMs": 4353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet this sound keeps\ngoing, always ascending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502920,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The trick is a Shepard\ntone isn't just one note."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506100,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are multiple\nfrequencies being played,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508380,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all separated by octaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510840,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of these frequencies are increasing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513330,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as they do, their volumes change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516390,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the high notes get quieter,\nand the low notes get louder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520110,
    "dDurationMs": 4246,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "High notes soon fade out, and\nnew low notes are faded in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524356,
    "dDurationMs": 4154,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This gives the illusion\nof an ever rising pitch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528510,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the audio version\nof a barbershop pole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533160,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shepard tones can also evoke emotional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535440,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or physical responses in some listeners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537840,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A 2016 study found that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539400,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after listening to Shepard tones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540750,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "participants reported feeling nervous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543120,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anxious, and disturbed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545250,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps that's why during\nan intense bombing scene"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547680,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the film, \"Dunkirk\"\nShepard tones feature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550380,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the accompanying score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556530,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully this won't make you uneasy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559080,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I want you to try to figure\nout which well-known tune,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562590,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is, all of the notes\nhave been kept the same,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566130,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they've been mixed up\ninto different octaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570093,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577050,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you recognize the song?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579300,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, here is the unscrambled melody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581880,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589290,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now that you've heard that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590850,
    "dDurationMs": 2296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can you follow the scrambled version?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593146,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601470,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To me, it's fascinating\nhow the second time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603720,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard the scrambled melody,\nthe tune seemed obvious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606450,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is very different from\nhow it sounded the first time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609750,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our brains can find patterns\nin random sounds too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613260,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the phantom word illusion created"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615540,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by Dr. Diana Deutsch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617400,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen to this audio"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618420,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and try to figure out\nwhich words are being said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621150,
    "dDurationMs": 3583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can put what you\nheard in the comments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631245,
    "dDurationMs": 2175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When one speaker plays a word,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633420,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the second speaker plays a different word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635490,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636930,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to Dr. Deutsch,\nbecause the signals are mixed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639870,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the air before they reach your ears,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642120,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're given a pile of sounds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643800,
    "dDurationMs": 3693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to choose from, so you can\ncreate words in your mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649080,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of what we hear depends\nnot on the frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651900,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of sound, but on how\nour brains process them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655530,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Deutsch noticed that when\nshe played this illusion near"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657900,
    "dDurationMs": 3727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exam week, students reported\nhearing words like, \"No brain,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661627,
    "dDurationMs": 2993,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I'm tired,\" or \"No time.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664620,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we can actually\nprime the brain to hear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666960,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we want it to hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668280,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, using text."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670200,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take the case of this crowd chanting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672745,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(crowd chanting)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679650,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're primed to hear the lyrics you see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682980,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are called Mondegreens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685080,
    "dDurationMs": 2497,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after a misheard poem\nin which there's a line,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687577,
    "dDurationMs": 2393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"They have slain the Earl Amurray"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689970,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Lady Mondegreen.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691950,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except in the real poem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693330,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Earl dies alone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694800,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his killers actually\nlaid him on the green."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699300,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes mondegreens happen\nwhen sounds are divided"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702150,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "logically, but incorrectly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703710,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such as hearing pullet surprise\ninstead of Pulitzer Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708000,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Language familiarity would help you hear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709980,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the correct one from the start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711540,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while UK football fans\nmight hear the common chant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714780,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is embarrassing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716070,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Crowd] That is embarrassing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718080,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- An American football fan might not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722220,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's even more amazing is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723870,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how subtle visual cues\ncan affect what we hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727740,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What am I saying in this clip?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733980,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you heard the word bear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735930,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's because that's what I was saying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738000,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what am I saying in this clip?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744360,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I bet you heard fair,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746580,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you play back both\nthose clips without looking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749820,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll find it's the exact same audio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751989,
    "dDurationMs": 2691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All we changed was the mouth movement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754680,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I can prove it to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756060,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by playing those two\nclips at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758490,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you hear will\nchange depending on which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761250,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clip you focus on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770700,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we see affects what we hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773520,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reverse is also true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776250,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this illusion if no sound is played,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it looks like the two circles are passing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780630,
    "dDurationMs": 2839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through each other, but at\na sound when they intersect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783469,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(balls dashing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784470,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and immediately it seems like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786330,
    "dDurationMs": 1687,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're bouncing off each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788017,
    "dDurationMs": 1823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(balls dashing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789840,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we see and hear are\nintrinsically linked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792360,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because in the real world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793920,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one sense can reliably inform the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797250,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if there are\nno visual cues to go on?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800790,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 1950s, air traffic\ncontrollers were communicating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803520,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with multiple pilots\nsimultaneously in the same room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807270,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfortunately, messages from all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809100,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the pilots would play\nfrom a single loudspeaker,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812400,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the overlapping audio\nmade it really difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pick out just one voice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816840,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So researchers started\nlooking into the so-called"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819360,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cocktail party effect,\nbecause this problem resembled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822480,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "focusing on a single\nvoice in a noisy room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825840,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of us can do this with\nlittle effort, but how?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829770,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of like taking the recording"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831540,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the entire party and pulling out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833250,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a particular voices waveform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836100,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sound waves interfere with each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837960,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before reaching your ears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839220,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this should be a difficult task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842340,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this recording, try\nto find the voice talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844710,
    "dDurationMs": 1781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about a flight in this crowd."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846491,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(crowd talking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855540,
    "dDurationMs": 1499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I find that really hard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857039,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you hear the voice\nfirst, then the rest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860160,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the conversation is easier to follow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862580,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(crowd talking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870600,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is much easier\nbecause you can predict"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873150,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what words will come next based on context"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875280,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and language structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877440,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second way we can focus\non one voice is by identifying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880950,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the sound is coming from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883110,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen again, but this\ntime focus on the pilot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885390,
    "dDurationMs": 1609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "played in your left ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886999,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(crowd talking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894960,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a cocktail party, you\ncan focus on your friend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897300,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by ignoring sounds that\ncome from other locations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900480,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once researchers realized\nthis, they advocated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903180,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that different pilots be broadcast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904890,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through different speakers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906270,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spread out throughout the control room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908580,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allowed air traffic controllers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910710,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to more successfully\ntune in to their pilot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916470,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how do we actually\nlocate the source of a sound?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919800,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I'm gonna put on this blindfold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921720,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ask my wife to walk around me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923610,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and clap in different locations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925920,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I am going to try to point\nto the location of the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929700,
    "dDurationMs": 1917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's give it a try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932550,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Normally you can pinpoint a sound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934320,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to within a degree or two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936330,
    "dDurationMs": 1929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are actually four different cues"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938259,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that help me identify the\nlocation of the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940980,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942540,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944280,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A sound on my right will\nbe louder in my right ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947370,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My head sort of casts a sound\nshadow over my left ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951240,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the second cue is that\nthis shadow attenuates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954330,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "higher frequencies more\nthan low frequencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957420,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kinda like when your\nneighbor is having a party."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959430,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't really hear the high\nfrequencies like the lyrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962430,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you can hear the bass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964200,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because low frequencies\nare less attenuated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966750,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by distance and obstacles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968970,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third is time delay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970950,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes a sound half a\nmillisecond to cross your head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974520,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so sound will usually arrive\nat one ear before the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978600,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen to a beep on your left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980633,
    "dDurationMs": 1117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981750,
    "dDurationMs": 1508,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then on your right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983258,
    "dDurationMs": 1552,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984810,
    "dDurationMs": 2789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, as the delay between\nthose two beeps is shortened,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987599,
    "dDurationMs": 1651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(ound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989250,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's less of an echo\nand more just one sound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994080,
    "dDurationMs": 2088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's really on your left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996168,
    "dDurationMs": 1902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998070,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth cue we use\nto identify the source"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000380,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a sound is at what\npoint in the wave cycle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003260,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the sound arrives at each\near or the phase of the wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006980,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it arriving at a peak or a trough?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009800,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The phase of the wave at one\near will typically be different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013010,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the phase at the other ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015590,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you run into a bit of trouble"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017180,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the sound is either directly in front"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019400,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or behind you or on any\npoint in a vertical plane"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023240,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that passes through the\nmiddle of your head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's because the\ndistance from the sound to both"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026420,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your ears is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027650,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore, those four\ncues aren't very useful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031100,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Owls solve this issue\nwith asymmetrical ears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034280,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their left ear is actually lower on their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036470,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "head than their right ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037820,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sounds from below are\nlouder in their lower left ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042890,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Humans typically have symmetric ears,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044900,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but their shapes are important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047300,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where the outer\npart of your ear comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, what we'd normally\njust refer to as the ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052640,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Technically this is called the pinna."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054980,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on the location\nand the frequency of sound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058460,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will bounce off these ridges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060709,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and bumps on your ear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063050,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and end up inside your ear\nactually going into the eardrum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066830,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those reflections will actually change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069620,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some frequencies differently than others"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072140,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depending on the location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073850,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists placed tiny microphones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076250,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside volunteer's ears to measure this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078740,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could see, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079940,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a 6,000 hertz sound located"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081920,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "above you might be\namplified by 10 decibels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084920,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that same sound below\nyou would be attenuated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088310,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by 10 decibels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090110,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These figures depend on the unique bumps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092420,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ridges of cartilage in your ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095090,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So each person's ears have\na unique response curve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098180,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to different frequencies\nat different locations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101810,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the course of our lives,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103670,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our brains learn the way\ndifferent frequencies reflect off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106880,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our ears, and we use that information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109220,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to identify the source of the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112580,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, every person has\na unique pinna shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116120,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what if our ears changed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119720,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a 1998 study,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120950,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "researchers placed small\nmolds into the ears of a group"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123890,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of participants changing\nthe shape of their pinnas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's one subject's data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129590,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rigid background grid represents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131870,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where sounds were actually played."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134000,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The dots are the subject's guesses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136040,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the darker warped grid is\nthe averages of those guesses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140330,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before the study, they were\nfairly good at locating sounds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143720,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but after changing their pinna shape,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145510,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were downright terrible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148430,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over a series of days and\nweeks with their new pinnas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151910,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the participants all adjusted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153860,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and became better at locating sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156830,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is something your\nbrain can adapt to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160040,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thankfully, after the molds were removed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162140,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "participants had no trouble reverting back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164450,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to their original ears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167300,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pinna shape is so key to an\nimmersive sound experience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170450,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in virtual reality that\ncompanies like Apple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173030,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Sony actually scan your ears"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175220,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create personalized spatial audio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179870,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for a long time, people\nhave been trying to harness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182570,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and amplify our ability to locate sounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185720,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1880, professor Alfred\nMayer presented a device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188780,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called a topophone to\nlocate ships in the fog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191960,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was made from two\nadjustable hearing cones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194930,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By changing the distance\nand angle between them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197270,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sailors could narrow down the\ndirection of a ship's foghorn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202250,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfortunately, they weren't very useful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204380,
    "dDurationMs": 3197,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because sound waves interact with fog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207577,
    "dDurationMs": 3793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then during World War I\nlocating bombing planes on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211370,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "approach was of central importance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213920,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So armies developed special\nequipment called sound mirrors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216980,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to amplify sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219110,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Britain, sound mirror\nstations coordinated together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221870,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to locate an enemy up to\n15 minutes in advance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225650,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as planes became faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227630,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sound mirrors couldn't\ndetect them early enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230510,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were eventually abandoned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231770,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the invention of radar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234020,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even though the\ntechnology became obsolete,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236240,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the system was not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237980,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The radar team used the\ncoordinating station's idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240830,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was first developed from\nthe Sound Mirror program."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244190,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Linked radar stations\nwere a critical defense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246890,
    "dDurationMs": 2083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Battle of Britain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258140,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the Vox Angelica on\nthe Sydney Town Hall Organ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262280,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When two pipes are slightly out of tune,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264560,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's this pulsing effect to the sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268010,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can hear that in a more pronounced way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269750,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I play pure tones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271610,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is a pure 261 hertz sine wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274447,
    "dDurationMs": 3283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277730,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a pure 263 hertz sine wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280159,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282860,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When both of these tones\nplay, those compression"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285590,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and refraction waves\ninterfere with each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288590,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes the peaks line up\nto produce a louder sound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292280,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when a peak lines up with\na trough, they cancel out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295490,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because these frequencies\nare separated by two hertz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298310,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you hear two louder pulses every second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301520,
    "dDurationMs": 1696,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as beating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303216,
    "dDurationMs": 1874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305090,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the beats are really clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308420,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this makes sense when the two waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310250,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are interfering in the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312170,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what happens if a 261\nhertz tone is played in one ear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316820,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a 263 hertz tone\nis played in the other?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320354,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325880,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What did you hear?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327890,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the tones never\nhad a chance to interact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331010,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you can still hear\nsome subtle beating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334610,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your brain is firing\nat a rate corresponding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337310,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the phase difference\ncausing the beat perception."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341510,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When your brain mixes\nthese frequencies together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343910,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's called Binaural Beats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345329,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sound beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347510,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And maybe you've already\nheard of Binaural Beats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350300,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a quick search of YouTube shows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352010,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that some people claim they\ncan improve focus or memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355370,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a 2023 review was inconclusive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358250,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and emphasized the need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359480,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for more standardized testing methods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363140,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Audio illusions aren't\na sign that our sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365270,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of hearing is faulty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366470,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, the world is a messy, noisy place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368840,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and our brains have\ndeveloped complex methods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371000,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deal with ambiguity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372740,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You fill in the gaps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373940,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with your past experiences\nor expectations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377060,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without your brain making these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378650,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "subconscious adjustments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379880,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a cocktail party would always\njust sound like a total mess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384380,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Audio illusions show us where\nour perception goes wrong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387440,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the system as a whole is pretty good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390399,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at getting to the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392543,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(static hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398120,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, illusions remind us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399710,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can't always take\nthe world at face value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402410,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while our unconscious minds\nmight fill in the gaps from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405320,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time to time, it's our\ncritical thinking skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408020,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that do the heavy lifting of\nseparating fact from fiction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411470,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you are looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412670,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start building these\nskills yourself, you can do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414860,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that right now for free with\ntoday's sponsor, Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418730,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant will make you a better thinker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420680,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and problem solver while\nhelping you build real skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423590,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in everything from math"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425180,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and data analysis to programming,\ntechnology, whatever it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429740,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you're curious about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431300,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On Brilliant, you'll learn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432500,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through discovery by trying\nthings out for yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435110,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you'll not only gain\nknowledge of key concepts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437630,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll learn to apply them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438740,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to real world situations all\nwhile building your intuition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442880,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This gives you the tools"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444260,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to solve whatever problems come your way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446960,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, learning something\nnew every day is one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449570,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the most important things\nyou can do for yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452000,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Brilliant is the perfect way to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454460,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have thousands of bite-sized lessons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456830,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can do in just minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458690,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now, I'm spending a\nlittle time each day in their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460910,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "logic course, which has been a great way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462770,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to brush up on my own skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464270,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of discerning what's true and false."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466880,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the best part about\nBrilliant is you can learn from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469580,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anywhere right on your phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471590,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So whenever you have a few minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473390,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spend them building a\nquicker, sharper mind."
    } ]
  }, {
